    <div class="flow-step"><b>Use</b><span>Guide a fictional visitor step by step.</span></div>
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">Imperatives are everyday grammar for directions, instructions, recipes, warnings, and plans. They are the fastest way to help another person do something.</p>

  <h2>Two-minute retrieval</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="practice" data-choice-gap-drill data-success-message="Correct. You retrieved an object form, a present ability limit, and a two-reference place relation.">
