        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Let’s order lunch.">Let’s order lunch.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Order us lunch.">Order us lunch.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="We ordering lunch.">We ordering lunch.</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Can you help me with this report, please?" data-hint="The manager can reasonably accept or refuse, so a request question gives more room than a bare command." data-fix="Can you help me with this report, please?">
