      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="you" data-hint="An ordinary imperative directly addresses the listener or listeners, understood as you." data-fix="In Turn left at the light, the understood addressee is you.">
        <p class="quiz-question">5. In the ordinary direction “Turn left at the light,” who is the understood addressee?</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="you">you</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="we">we</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="the street">the street</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Text" data-hint="A positive instruction begins with the base verb Text." data-fix="Text the fictional host when the plane lands.">
        <p class="quiz-question">6. A fictional arrival card gives a positive contact step: ___ the host when the plane lands.</p>
