        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Have some coffee.">Have some coffee.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="You will have coffee.">You will have coffee.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Having coffee.">Having coffee.</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="worry" data-hint="After Don’t, use the base verb worry with no to or -ing." data-fix="Don’t worry about small mistakes.">
        <p class="quiz-question">8. Complete the supportive negative instruction: Don’t ___ about small mistakes.</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="worry">worry</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="to worry">to worry</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="worrying">worrying</button></div>
