      <div class="choice-bank" aria-label="Next-day imperative and request openings">
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="Open">Open</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="Don’t">Don’t</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="Let’s">Let’s</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="Can you">Can you</button>
      </div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>The interface gives one neutral positive step: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="Open" data-hint="A neutral positive instruction begins directly with the base verb Open." data-fix="Open the Settings menu." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> the Settings menu.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>An exposed wire creates immediate danger: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="Don’t" data-hint="The urgent warning prohibits touching, so begin with Don’t." data-fix="Don’t touch the wire." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> touch the wire.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>The speaker proposes one group plan: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="Let’s" data-hint="A shared suggestion that includes the speaker and listener begins with Let’s." data-fix="Let’s meet in the lobby." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> meet in the lobby.</span></div>
